{"2466680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kebab Chefs: Prologue", "steam_appid": 2466680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466680/extras/2b4e2f4d3147388f71c61f7448f480c6.avif?t=1780676834\" width=900 height=290 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>◆ In this Prologue version, you will experiencing every aspects of being a restaurant owner! Starting from renovating a small restaurant, learn how to cook delicious dishes, feed hungry customers and grow your restaurant business!  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466680/extras/3994786c6c4354cc1839420fe6067830.avif?t=1780676834\" width=620 height=177 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466680/extras/cc70e7c4c86cc3472080c87259216b08.poster.avif?t=1780676834\" width=606 height=238 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466680/extras/cc70e7c4c86cc3472080c87259216b08.webm?t=1780676834\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466680/extras/cc70e7c4c86cc3472080c87259216b08.mp4?t=1780676834\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>◆ Expand your recipe book and learn to cook various recipes from different cuisines around the world! Main courses, soups, appetizers, and desserts all waiting for your magic touch! Create a menu among these recipes, cook to perfection and raise your income as you do!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2466680/extras/140bd7dc07c39b2ae37a9b